  "source": "phenotypes.yaml",
  "two_sets": "`phenotypes` scores the DISORDER facet, which is what the shipped measured_set_recall describes. `phenotypes_union` scores what a pheno=X target actually selects \u2014 every facet unioned. Precision for the union keeps the same independent answer key (the SNOMED isa closure of the seed), so it is a strict LOWER bound: a medication concept cannot appear under a disease seed's closure, so union PRECISION is not measurable here and is reported null rather than as a near-zero that would read as imprecision. The disorder facet remains the specificity anchor.",
  "why_two_recalls": "span_recall bounds what a corruption operator can reach; set_recall bounds whether phenotype_scope is correct. A mention missed under protect mode is never protected, and the run still reports evidence_touch=0 because measurement and protection read the same span set \u2014 set_recall is what makes that zero non-vacuous."
}
